WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.030
Toggle A, B and carry-in to see sum and carry change.

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.139
1+1+1 is 3, or binary 11.

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:11.005
The lower bit is S and the next bit is carry-out.

00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:15.542
A full adder combines three inputs to produce which two outputs?

00:00:15.542 --> 00:00:19.080
The sum bit and the carry-out represent a binary addition result.
